{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/description.logo1.png?t=1751678893\" /></div><i>&quot;They dreamt about you last night in their worst nightmares. It's your time to shine, Terry. You are their Augury of Death.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Augurium Mortis is a fast-paced top-down arena shooter where you control Amy Sol, a fighter hovercraft ace pilot singled out and cornered by her sworn enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She has nothing to loose and will fight to the death in a deep jungle located in a dystopian world in a planet far away into the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0   \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/kill.gif?t=1751678893\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fend off waves of mechs and large robots trying with your weapon arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load up your charge by killing enemies, special moves grant you more energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash your ultra to deal devastating blows to the enemy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Music</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">John Black</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Different types of enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0    \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/block.gif?t=1751678893\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mech Soldier (R-11): a fast and nimble robot with a sword that will pressure you relentlessly. It's not a real mech, the manufacturer name it like that for marketing purposes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mech Tank: A fast large mech with a thick skin that can take a punch. Beware of it's AoE attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sniper Vehicle: A mid range war tank with a precision shot. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rocket Launcher: A long range barrage missile launcher that won't stop putting pressure on you until you take it out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete tasks to fully unleash the power of your arsenal by unlocking new weapons and parts and optimize your destruction power to infinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0    \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/extras/shocker.gif?t=1751678893\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2816740?t=1751678893","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751678893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751678893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751678893","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn